    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d312">

                <pb facs="0525" n="239" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg239"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Germany</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-22T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 22, 1916, 4 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2927. Your 3780, April 20. Cable at once the exact words, as nearly as you can
                    remember, used by Von Jagow when he stated that Germany would not give up
                    sinking merchant ships without notice in war zone.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
